# Time Series Visualization of Failed Logins
# Creates a time-based chart to visualize attack patterns
# MITRE ATT&CK: T1110 - Brute Force
# Event Code: 4625 - An account failed to log on

index=main sourcetype="WinEventLog" EventCode=4625
| timechart span=1m count by src_ip

# Description:
# This query creates a time series chart showing failed login attempts
# over time, grouped by source IP. Useful for visualizing attack patterns
# and identifying when an attack began and ended.
#
# Dashboard Integration:
# - Save as a panel in the Detection Engineering1 dashboard
# - Set visualization type to Column Chart
# - Use with a 5-minute time window for real-time monitoring
